abstract: |
  This repository contains the source-available Lean 4 companion artifact for
  five manuscripts by Moses Rahnama: "The Orientation Boundary for
  Step-Duplicating Recursors: A Machine-Checked Structural Theory of Termination
  Proofs," "Observer Determinacy of Termination Certificates: Sufficient
  Statistics, Blackwell Comparison, and Simple Projections for Step-Duplicating
  Recursion," "Confluence on the Normalizing Core: Normal Forms Without
  Termination or Global Normalization," "Entangled Merged Pairs: The
  Observation-Boundary Principle," and "A Counterexample to Lemma 64 of the Kahrs and Smith Proof for RTA-79."

  This package contains the Lean 4 modules named by those manuscripts or
  required to compile them, the TTT2 and CeTA artifacts, and the four
  claim-to-code indexes.
